  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あれっ、もう朝～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「んん。やだぁ、お布団からでたくない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「今日やけに寒くない？　まだ雪が降ってるのかなぁ、あと五分だけ寝させて～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「でも。お姉ちゃんが優しく抱きしめて、あっためてくれるなら……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あたし起きちゃうっ、お姉ちゃあ～ん☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「おはようのハグ！　か～ら～の～、おはようのチュウ……んのわぁああ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あっぶな！　転校生の先輩だこれ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「寝起きにドッキリさせないでっ、心臓が止まるかと思った……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あやうくキスしちゃうところだったよ、何で先輩がいるんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あぁ、雪かきをしてくれてたんですね。助かっちゃいます、とっても♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「あたし雪かきしてたら手に『あかぎれ』ができちゃって、竹刀を握るときにつらかったんですよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "いちか",
    "text": "「男手があると、便利ですね。ていうか働きものですよね～、いつも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 7,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 28,
      "y": 474
